  total prior weight 0.625000 (must be 1/2 + 2^-K = 0.625000)
  k=0: brute 0.4800000000  formula (1-p) mu_k = 0.4800000000
  k=1: brute 0.2666666667  formula (1-p) mu_k = 0.2666666667
